        "heading": "How has Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P's federal business changed recently?",
        "body": "Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P obligations fell 51.3% year over year. Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P obligations peaked in FY24 at $2.3B and are $1.1B in FY26 to date. Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P received 31 awards in FY2026 to date with an average award size of $34M."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Where does Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P concentrate its federal work?",
        "body": "Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P concentrates on Military Armored Vehicle, Tank, and Tank Component Manufacturing, with $995M in FY2026 to date obligations. Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P also records $39.5M in Engineering Services and $19.8M in Motor Vehicle Gasoline Engine and Engine Parts Manufacturing. Bae Systems Land and Armaments L P shows zero obligations so far in several listed NAICS markets, including Current-Carrying Wiring Device Manufacturing and Other Electronic Component Manufacturing."
      }
